msgid "AI Agents & Chat for Amazon Bedrock"
msgstr "AI Agents & Chat for Amazon Bedrock"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: ai-chat-for-amazon-bedrock.php
msgid "https://github.com/noteflowai/ai-chat-for-amazon-bedrock"
msgstr "https://github.com/noteflowai/ai-chat-for-amazon-bedrock"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ai-chat-for-amazon-bedrock.php
msgid "Streaming chat and governed tool-using agents on Amazon Bedrock, with IAM role credentials, a standards-compliant MCP server and client, and security-first defaults."
msgstr "基于 Amazon Bedrock 的流式对话和受管控的工具调用智能体，支持 IAM 角色凭证、符合标准的 MCP 服务器和客户端，并默认采用安全优先的配置。"

