msgstr "你无权在此站点上运行评估。"

#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-eval.php:21
msgid "Write questions whose right answer you already know, then run them. Each question goes through the same pipeline the chat uses, and the result is reported by category, so you can tell which part of an answer changed. Every check is a program: nothing here scores style, tone or helpfulness, and a model is never asked to judge another model."
msgstr "编写你已知正确答案的问题，然后运行它们。每个问题都会经过与对话相同的处理流程，结果按类别报告，因此你可以看出答案的哪一部分发生了变化。每项检查都是一段程序：这里不会对风格、语气或有用程度打分，也从不让一个模型评判另一个模型。"

#. translators: %s: the WP-CLI command, already escaped.
#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-eval.php:27
#, php-format
msgid "A run sends one Amazon Bedrock request per case, so it happens only when you ask. The same set runs from the command line with %s, which exits nonzero when a case fails and can gate a deployment."
msgstr "每次运行会为每个用例发送一次 Amazon Bedrock 请求，因此只会在你要求时运行。同一组用例也可以在命令行中通过 %s 运行，只要有用例失败，该命令就会以非零状态退出，可用于把关部署。"

#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-eval.php:33
msgid "Cases"
msgstr "测试用例"

#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-eval.php:35
msgid "Expect \"grounded\" when the site should answer from its own content, \"unsupported\" when it has nothing on the subject and must not invent specifics, or \"tool\" when a named tool should be called. Leave a field empty to skip that check for the case; a skipped check is reported as unchecked, never as a pass."
msgstr "当站点应根据自身内容回答时，将预期设为“grounded”；当站点没有相关内容且不得编造细节时，设为“unsupported”；当应调用指定工具时，设为“tool”。将某个字段留空即可跳过该用例的这项检查；跳过的检查会报告为未检查，绝不会算作通过。"

